471fca2e:  ;
 ;The EDIT subroutine is responsible for updating a record in the VAS(393) file.
 ;It locks the record, checks if the record is successfully locked, and then updates
 ;specific fields with the provided data. After updating, it unlocks the record.
 ;

36aaa27d:  ;
 ;The DCSDEL subroutine is designed for deleting a record from the VAS(393) file.
 ;It locks the record for editing, checks if lock was successful, and if so, clears
 ;specified fields effectively deleting record content while keeping the record itself.
 ;Finally, it unlocks the record post-deletion.
 ;

